<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>ENVIRONMENTAL CDS THIRD QUARTER REPORT 2026</title>
<style>
  @page {
    size: letter landscape;
    margin: 8mm 12mm 8mm 12mm;
  }
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  body {
    font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    line-height: 1.2;
    background: #fff;
  }

  /* Header Section */
  .header-container {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .header-logo-left {
    width: 60px;
    height: auto;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .header-logo-spacer {
    width: 60px;
    height: 1px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .header-center {
    text-align: center;
    flex-grow: 1;
    padding: 0 10px;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 12.5pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    margin: 0 0 2px 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .header-subtitle-dept {
    font-size: 11pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-decoration: underline;
    margin: 0 0 2px 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
  }
  .header-subtitle-group {
    font-size: 10.5pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-decoration: underline;
    margin: 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
  }

  /* Metadata Section */
  .meta-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 6px 0 8px 0;
    padding: 0 5px;
  }
  .meta-item {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .meta-val {
    display: inline-block;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    min-width: 90px;
    padding: 0 8px 1px 8px;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  /* Table Section */
  table.report-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
  }
  table.report-table th,
  table.report-table td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 6px 7px;
    vertical-align: top;
    font-size: 9pt;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  table.report-table th {
    background-color: #f7f7f7;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    vertical-align: middle;
    font-size: 8.8pt;
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
    padding: 6px 4px;
  }
  
  .col-sn { width: 4.5%; text-align: center; }
  .col-group { width: 12%; text-align: left; }
  .col-cm { width: 6.5%; text-align: center; }
  .col-loc { width: 14%; text-align: left; }
  .col-lga { width: 7%; text-align: center; }
  .col-act { width: 31%; text-align: justify; }
  .col-ach { width: 14%; text-align: left; }
  .col-rem { width: 11%; text-align: left; }

  td.center { text-align: center; }
  td.dash { text-align: center; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: middle; }

  .act-title {
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  /* Sign-off Footer */
  .sign-container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin-top: 15px;
    padding: 0 5px;
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .sign-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 220px;
    padding: 0 12px 1px 12px;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="header-container">
    <img src="data:image/png;base64," class="header-logo-left" alt="NYSC Logo">
    <div class="header-center">
      <div class="header-title">National Youth Service Corps National Directorate Headquarters</div>
      <div class="header-subtitle-dept">Community Development Service Department</div>
      <div class="header-subtitle-group">Environmental Community Development Service Group</div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-logo-spacer"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Metadata -->
  <div class="meta-row">
    <div class="meta-item">STATE: <span class="meta-val">CROSS RIVER</span></div>
    <div class="meta-item">ZONE: <span class="meta-val">OBUDU</span></div>
    <div class="meta-item">QUARTER: <span class="meta-val">3RD</span></div>
    <div class="meta-item">YEAR: <span class="meta-val">2026</span></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Table -->
  <table class="report-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th class="col-sn">S/N</th>
        <th class="col-group">NAME OF GROUP</th>
        <th class="col-cm">NUMBER<br>OF C/MS</th>
        <th class="col-loc">LOCATION</th>
        <th class="col-lga">LGA</th>
        <th class="col-act">NATURE OF ACTIVITIES</th>
        <th class="col-ach">ACHIEVEMENTS</th>
        <th class="col-rem">REMARKS</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-sn">1.</td>
        <td class="col-group">Environmental CDS Group</td>
        <td class="col-cm">11</td>
        <td class="col-loc">Ogoja Road, Obudu</td>
        <td class="col-lga">Obudu</td>
        <td class="col-act">
          <span class="act-title">OUTREACH:</span> Environmental sanitation and community sensitization conducted along Ogoja Road, Obudu. 11 corps members engaged in street sweeping, refuse collection, clearing roadside litter, and sensitizing shop owners, residents, and commuters on avoiding indiscriminate waste dumping and maintaining a clean roadway.
        </td>
        <td class="col-ach">
          55 residents, traders, and road users (30 males and 25 females) were sensitized on environmental hygiene; the road corridor was effectively swept and cleared of refuse.
        </td>
        <td class="col-rem">
          Shop owners and residents appreciated the group members' sanitation efforts and committed to keeping their shop frontages clean.
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-sn dash">2.</td>
        <td class="dash">-</td>
        <td class="dash">-</td>
        <td class="dash">-</td>
        <td class="dash">-</td>
        <td class="dash">-</td>
        <td class="dash">-</td>
        <td class="dash">-</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-sn">3.</td>
        <td class="col-group">Environmental CDS Group</td>
        <td class="col-cm">3</td>
        <td class="col-loc">Handmaids International Nursery and Primary School, Obudu</td>
        <td class="col-lga">Obudu</td>
        <td class="col-act">
          <span class="act-title">OUTREACH:</span> Waste management and environmental hygiene outreach conducted at Handmaids International Nursery and Primary School, Obudu. 3 corps members educated pupils and teachers on proper waste disposal, separating refuse, personal hygiene, and keeping classroom surroundings clean. The CDS group donated sanitation items including Baskets, Brooms, Packers, and Mop to the school.
        </td>
        <td class="col-ach">
          35 pupils and school staff (15 males and 20 females) were educated on waste management; sanitation items (Baskets, Brooms, Packers, and Mop) were successfully donated to support school cleanliness.
        </td>
        <td class="col-rem">
          The pupils and school management were happy and grateful for the donated sanitation materials and demonstrated enthusiasm for maintaining a clean learning environment.
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <!-- Signatures -->
  <div class="sign-container">
    <div>SCHEDULE OFFICER: <span class="sign-line">OKO JOHN</span></div>
    <div>SIGNATURE &amp; DATE: <span class="sign-line">24/9/2026</span></div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
